<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 790, May 1. We came to Megasawa once again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Morning, morning!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"M-morning. You're awfully energetic..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ohhh-ho-ho-ho! There's nothing I'm afraid of anymore!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That way you talk sounds like an old lady, doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had rapidly gotten back to her old self since then, and seemed to have become more energetic than necessary.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chaaan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花子供ショート全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumiii</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And the two of them started wrestling again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, it's moving day today, so you two help out properly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Gyahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That tickles, that tickles!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're not listening at all...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> had cut her hair short after that, I was told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently, with long hair, her wound hurt whenever it caught on things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More eye-catching than that was how much <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True enough, it was a little old-lady-ish, or something...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"All right, that's all the luggage loaded. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you ride in </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s car."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花子供ショート全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Hurry and get in!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"H-hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, whatever you do, please drive safely, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ohhh-ho-ho-ho! It's fine! I won't lose to any car out there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that's not what I meant...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this going to be okay...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Phew, that's all the luggage carried in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahahaha! We're next door to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花子供ショート全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"We can have sleepovers all the time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the Niimuras' move was complete.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As of today, the Kogoris and the Niimuras were next door to each other.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Can I go explore around here with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well! It looks like a lot's changed around here too, so go on, off you go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't go too far, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
By the time I said it, the two of them were already gone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, let's take a break. I've made tea."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my, thank youuu!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that way you talk really does sound like an old lady, doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's better than being all gloomy like before, isn't it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Ohhh-hohohohoho!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> went inside with a loud laugh.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> always goes to extremes..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> grew up together and graduated from elementary school and middle school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond anything I had imagined, the Kogoris and the Niimuras built a good relationship.<PG>
And then 10 years went by―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shiyo 800, April 7<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm off!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Be careful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> opened the door, a gust of wind blew in for a moment.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! It's about time you cut back on drinking!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says so!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah, r-right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Dammit, that <STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro</STYLE> was still watching over us through <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, same as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since that time, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s cherry-blossom phobia had gone completely quiet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then the door opened.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, hey there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time it was <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> who poked her head in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, be careful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Come to think of it, what are you doing once you get to the station over there? It's pretty far, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s coming to pick us up in the car. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">She went on ahead 'cause she's busy with the preparations, but she says she should be free by the time we get there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">See ya!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
This time, it seemed, they'd really left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth was, today <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> were heading off to a certain place for an overnight stay.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm still against it. Going to that Arata settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I know how you feel... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> says so, there's nothing we can do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tomorrow, <STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s thirteenth-year memorial service was to be held in the Arata settlement. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Originally, the plan had been for me and <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, who had been given special permission, to attend, but―<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> are both with them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s by their side, so there's nothing to worry about, is there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, please..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We have an unspoken rule: in this season, we always heed <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s warnings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> tells us 'Don't go to the thirteenth-year memorial service,' we have no choice but to obey.<PG>
And if <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> says 'I have to be the one to go,' we have no choice but to let her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, the reason <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> ended up attending instead of us―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
came down to <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What danger lurked in the Arata settlement, neither I nor <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s thirteenth-year memorial service, something was going to happen in the Arata settlement.<PG>
I'd thought the business in Megasawa City was settled, but in fact one worry remained.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was that the person who had sent <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> the weapons and drugs really did exist.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether that person would go on being someone who did us no harm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> might come face-to-face with that person.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's finally going to come out, isn't it? What that Arata settlement is about."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah. Finally... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The 'someone I can trust,' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">the culture of using Noh masks, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">that drug."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Surely...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">it won't turn out it would've been better to kill those children in Megasawa City... will it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No... surely not..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{CREATECG "エンド画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\ルートエンド.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
